<title>CHINA: Peregrine issues call warrants on red chip basket.</title>
<headline>Peregrine issues call warrants on red chip basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Wednesday it issued 180 million American-style call warrants on a basket of red chip stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Merchants Hai Hong Holdings Co Ltd 0.1 share</p>
<p> China Everbright-IHD Pacific Ltd	   0.1 share</p>
<p> CITIC Pacific Ltd				0.1 share</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$7.50     PREMIUM	  23.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.2818   GEARING	  3.0x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   9.JUN.98    BOARD LOT	10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$8.3450   SETTLEMENT     21.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG   LISTING DATE   24.JUL.97</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>			  DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
